1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,176
Welcome to VoxStudio's Long-Form Speech Synthesizer.

2
00:00:04,476 --> 00:00:12,707
In large language audio models, generating very long continuous text often leads to acoustic drift or prosodic degradation.

3
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:21,840
To overcome this limitation, our Smart Segmenter breaks down articles, stories, or podcast scripts into semantic sentences.

4
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:27,276
Each segment is synthesized individually with consistent acoustic embeddings.

5
00:00:27,576 --> 00:00:39,360
Finally, all high-resolution 48kHz audio chunks are seamlessly stitched together with natural pause intervals, and an aligned SRT subtitle file is generated automatically.

